# Documents Output Folder

Do not use `/Users/koteswararao.venkata/Documents/Cursor/Documents`. That path is another machine.

## Canonical locations in this repo

| Domain | Path |
|---|---|
| Trading write-ups | `agents/ssr-st/workspace/Documents/` |
| ARR / FQC write-ups | `agents/arr-analyst/plans/` |

User-facing markdown (FULL CHECK, catalyst cards, next-day prep, validation notes) goes in those folders unless the user names another path.

## What does not belong there

Source, tests, skills, rules, and CLI code stay in their package directories (`tradepilot/`, `agents/*/skills/`, `.cursor/`).

## Behavior

1. Default to the domain folder above.
2. Update in place when the file already exists.
3. Confirm the final repo-relative path in the reply.
4. Honor an explicit override ("save this in X").
